factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  Reel script says the incident happened in Nallipalayam area; the article places it at Lakkampalayam Yaazh Nagar (Nallipalayam is the police station's jurisdiction and Sujay's home area, not the location).
  Reel script and captions state the date as November 1 and the victim left home on October 30; the article only says 'கடந்த, 1ல்' and 'கடந்த, 30ல்' with no month given, so the months are an invented detail.
  Reel script says the snatchers 'followed' (பின்தொடர்ந்து) him on the moped; the article says they came from behind (பின்னால் வந்த), which is close but the reel also says they 'followed' while the slide says 'பின்தொடர்ந்து வந்த' - minor wording drift, acceptable but noted.
  Reel script and captions say the 17-year-old boy and Umasankar were 'arrested' together with 'கைது செய்யப்பட்டனர்' as one event, which is accurate, but the reel omits that the arrest was made after a complaint and investigation details; more importantly the reel omits that Umasankar was sent to Salem Central Prison and the boy to a juvenile reform school in the caption only, while the reel_script does include it—no omission there.
  Headline and slides say 'மொபைல் பறித்த வாலிபர் உள்பட 2 பேர்' / '2 பேர் கைது' with the victim described as 'மாணவர்', but the article says the victim was an engineering final-year student which is accurate; however the slides_spec 'hl1' places the arrest location as Nallipalayam, which conflicts with the article's Lakkampalayam incident location.
